  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 41ce4d688ff7cd744ba3dfeac3d57738, type: 3}
    subtitle: Authorized for structural defense. I suggest reinforcing the corners;
      humans always seem to forget the corners.
  - clip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8b6e0456ae82ede4681e4450ea423e5c, type: 3}
